{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/fc9304e2d52f1dcf692f1807b6c65c8a.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/fc9304e2d52f1dcf692f1807b6c65c8a.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/fc9304e2d52f1dcf692f1807b6c65c8a.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/5eb419fda5082d4ec2798074da3b3323.webp?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out of the ashes comes Inferno.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inferno is a game about revealing the truth. It is a 2D platform adventure game heavily inspired by 16-bit platformers. Gameplay focuses on action and some light exploration. In this militaristic adventure, play as Kai; a sergeant in the Krorion Space Forces, searching for his ex-commanding officer, Ion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/46b4ea6d60bb5575d743a52e1bc57922.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/46b4ea6d60bb5575d743a52e1bc57922.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/46b4ea6d60bb5575d743a52e1bc57922.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the planet of Veden VI, full of dangerous creatures in its different caverns and environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/5325ee892a2febce5a07c6f7292f1378.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/5325ee892a2febce5a07c6f7292f1378.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/5325ee892a2febce5a07c6f7292f1378.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/f39a7cca133a1e38ec07f6419e80caf0.webp?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay and boss battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore many different dangerous areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight and responsive controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging platforming</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around tight, responsive controls with escalating encounters that demand both quick reflexes and smart positioning. As Kai\u2019s power intensifies, players unlock devastating abilities in his Inferno form \u2014 becoming a raw, destructive force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/92d6ea4eede75d47904be23666805003.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/92d6ea4eede75d47904be23666805003.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/92d6ea4eede75d47904be23666805003.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/bef15d082efcb830807ca6b0cdab10c2.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/bef15d082efcb830807ca6b0cdab10c2.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/bef15d082efcb830807ca6b0cdab10c2.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/d14e8b8353940ad26ba553692a9eb4a9.poster.avif?t=1760497157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/d14e8b8353940ad26ba553692a9eb4a9.webm?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/d14e8b8353940ad26ba553692a9eb4a9.mp4?t=1760497157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illustrated Sequences</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inferno\u2019s</i> story is told through striking illustrated cutscenes. These moments reveal Kai\u2019s story without ever stopping th